  "worked_solution": "Notice that we have  a block lower triangular matrix. Therefore, its determinant is equal to the product of the diagonal blocks' determinants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}8 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3q & -6 \\\\ 3 & 2 & p\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}8 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3q & -6 \\\\ 3 & 2 & p\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =8\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3q & -6 \\\\ 2 & p\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =8\\cdot (-5) \\\\  & =-40\\end{aligned}\n$$",
